{"v":1,"book":"Ps","ch":53,"verses":[{"n":0,"text":"To the choir director: according to mahalath. A Maschil of David","tok":[{"t":"To the choir director: according to "},{"t":"mahalath","s":["H4257"],"a":[2]},{"t":". A "},{"t":"Maschil","s":["H4905"],"a":[3]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"David","s":["H1732"],"a":[4]}]},{"n":1,"text":"The fool has said in his heart, There is no God. They are corrupt and commit abominable deeds; There is none who does good.","tok":[{"t":"The "},{"t":"fool","s":["H5036"],"a":[1]},{"t":" has "},{"t":"said","s":["H0559"],"a":[0]},{"t":" in his "},{"t":"heart","s":["H3820"],"a":[2]},{"t":", There is no "},{"t":"God","s":["H0430"],"a":[4]},{"t":". They are "},{"t":"corrupt","s":["H7843"],"a":[5]},{"t":" and commit "},{"t":"abominable","s":["H8581"],"a":[6]},{"t":" deeds; There is none who does "},{"t":"good","s":["H2896"],"a":[10]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":2,"text":"God looked down from heaven Upon the sons of men To see if there was anyone who had insight, Who seeks after God.","tok":[{"t":"God","s":["H0430"],"a":[0]},{"t":" looked "},{"t":"down","s":["H8259"],"a":[2]},{"t":" from "},{"t":"heaven","s":["H8064"],"a":[1]},{"t":" Upon the "},{"t":"sons","s":["H1121"],"a":[4]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"men","s":["H0120"],"a":[5]},{"t":" To "},{"t":"see","s":["H7200"],"a":[6]},{"t":" if there was anyone who had insight, Who "},{"t":"seeks","s":["H1875"],"a":[9]},{"t":" after "},{"t":"God","s":["H0430"],"a":[11]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":3,"text":"All of them have turned back; They are together perverse. There is none who does good; There is not even one.","tok":[{"t":"All of them have turned "},{"t":"back","s":["H5472"],"a":[1]},{"t":"; They are together perverse. There is none who does "},{"t":"good","s":["H2896"],"a":[6]},{"t":"; There is not even "},{"t":"one","s":["H0259"],"a":[9]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":4,"text":"Have they no knowledge, the workers of iniquity, Who eat up my people as they would eat up bread And do not call upon God?","tok":[{"t":"Have they no "},{"t":"knowled